            "notes": "## TIP\nYou can TP to someone to give them a good amount of healing with [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) and the clone. Don't hesitate to throw kunai immediately when you TP because [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) and the clone of [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) will do enough to heal most of the time.\n\n## POWER\n- [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b): This power gives you more survivability, and it's very good with the round 5 power.\n- [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) \n\n------\n## CORE\n- [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b)\n- [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)\n- [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) \n\n## RECOMMENDED\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n- [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69)",
